# Admin Assets (ANM)

Source paths below are under `packages/core/admin/` (assembled to `admin/` at plugin root in release builds).

## JavaScript

### `packages/core/admin/js/edminboost-anm-admin.js`

- Wrap in an IIFE with `'use strict'`.
- Scope DOM queries to `.edminboost-anm-wrap` or plugin-specific selectors.
- Use `fetch`/`admin-ajax.php` with `edminboostAnmData.ajaxUrl`, `nonce`, and localized `i18n` for errors/success.
- Inbox: sort/filter/pagination via `edminboost_anm_inbox_list` (updates `#edminboost-anm-inbox-rows` HTML from server-rendered partial); URL query sync for filters/sort/page.
- Inbox row actions: Read via `edminboost_anm_inbox_action` (`read`) — disables button and adds `.is-read`; snooze menu with toggle unsnooze (repeat duration or `.edminboost-anm-inbox-snooze-toggle` when `.is-snoozed`) — `setInboxSnoozeState()` from AJAX `snoozed` + `duration` payload.
- Rules: WP core preset conversion via `edminboost_anm_convert_wp_preset` (toggle undo supported); CRUD via save/delete/toggle AJAX with inline errors and empty state; delete uses core-style link + `confirm()`; match type includes CSS selector (`css`). Rule AJAX posts optional `context` (`site` default, `network` on Network Auto-Rules screen) — appended from localized `rulesContext` via shared request helper.
- Settings: tabbed UI via `initSettingsTabs()` on `[data-edminboost-anm-settings]` — `?tab=` query sync, `history.replaceState`, keyboard (Arrow/Home/End), `edminboost-anm-settings-tab` custom event; legacy `?tab=upsell` maps to `filtering`. Tools tab adds `.is-tab-tools` on the form (hides main Save button where appropriate). Preserve active tab in `_wp_http_referer` on submit; `.edminboost-anm-multisite-policy-form` submit forces `tab=multisite` in referer.
- Settings: digest live preview via `initDigestPreview()` — POST `edminboost_anm_digest_preview` with unsaved `digest[...]` fields (including `digest[send_weekday]`); renders structured `content` into `[data-edminboost-anm-digest-preview-content]` with `escapeHtml()`; updates next-send line from `next_send` in response; debounced refresh when preview panel is open; auto-load on Notifications tab (including `?tab=notifications` deep links).
- Settings: webhook live preview via `initWebhookPreview()` — POST `edminboost_anm_webhook_preview` with unsaved `webhook[message]` (server merges via `sanitize_webhook_settings()` with stored URL/enabled); shows sample line, alert `text`, and formatted JSON payload; debounced refresh; auto-load on Notifications tab.
- Settings (Access tab): `initHidingNotificationsSettings()` on `[data-edminboost-anm-hiding-visibility]` — radio modes with nested `.edminboost-anm-hiding-visibility-options__option` user pickers (`only` / `except`); syncs chips/hidden inputs via `edminboost_anm_search_users`.
- Shared settings preview helpers (top of file): `anmPreviewEscapeHtml`, `anmReadNoticePanelPreviewOptions`, `anmApplyNoticePanelPreviewColors`, `anmPreviewBuildMockBarHtml`, etc. — used by General display preview and Admin bar tab preview; escape all dynamic strings.
- Settings (Admin bar tab): `initNoticePanelPreview()` — always renders mock (no separate panel enable checkbox); toggles `.edminboost-anm-notice-panel-bell-row` (`syncBellRows`), applies panel color CSS vars on `#edminboost-anm-notice-panel-preview`, renders into `[data-edminboost-anm-notice-panel-preview-stage]` via shared preview helpers + `noticePanelPositionLayouts`; refreshes on tab switch (`edminboost-anm-settings-tab` → `admin_bar`).
- Plugin screens: `initHidePluginAdminNotices()` — adds `.edminboost-anm-notice-hidden` to stray `.notice` nodes (excludes admin bar panel preview and settings preview mocks including white label); CSS also via `EDMINBOOST_ANM_Notices::get_plugin_screen_notice_hide_css()`.
- Dashboard: Quick Status enable toggle reloads the page after successful AJAX save (reflects global kill switch across admin).
- Settings: field help via `initSettingsHelpTips()` — `.edminboost-anm-help-tip[data-tip]` with optional `data-tip-placement` (`below` default, `left`); hover/focus popup; `click`/`mousedown` use `stopPropagation` so tips do not toggle segmented controls.
- Settings: display experience — `initDisplayExperience()` on `[data-edminboost-anm-display-experience]` (preset card click selects radio); calls `anmRenderDisplayExperiencePreview(mode)` on mode change and when Admin bar tab fields change (style, badge, position, colors — unsaved values drive the General mock); advanced modes in `[data-edminboost-anm-display-experience-advanced]`; sticky right column `#edminboost-anm-display-experience-preview` (`data-preview-mode`, caption via `displayExperiencePreviewCaption*` i18n).
- Settings (General): `initGeneralOptionsPreview()` on `[data-edminboost-anm-general-options]` — `#edminboost-anm-general-options-preview` mock for update-nag toggles (`data-hide-plugin` / `data-hide-core` on frame) and reset-hidden scope; caption only when core/plugin nags hidden or reset scope is all users; listens for bubbling `edminboost-anm-reset-hidden-success` to reveal sample hidden notice; `generalOptionsPreview*` i18n (no default/me-only caption strings).
- Settings (White label): `initWhiteLabelPreview()` on `[data-edminboost-anm-white-label]` — `#edminboost-anm-white-label-preview` mock (menu, dashboard top bar, plugins row meta); debounced refresh on field input; auto-refresh on `edminboost-anm-settings-tab` → `white_label`; `whiteLabelPreview*` i18n; escape all dynamic strings.
- Settings: ad redirect URL list — `initBlockAdRedirectsSettings()` on `[data-edminboost-anm-redirect-block]`; clones hidden template row `.edminboost-anm-redirect-block-row-template` into `[data-edminboost-anm-redirect-block-rows]`; `block_ad_redirects[urls][]` inputs.
- No jQuery unless WordPress already loads it for the screen.
- Use `DOMContentLoaded` for initialization.

### `packages/core/admin/js/edminboost-anm-interceptor.js`

- Loaded on all wp-admin when plugin is enabled (`EDMINBOOST_ANM_Interceptor::enqueue_interceptor_script()`).
- Observes/captures admin notices and POSTs to `edminboost_anm_capture_notice`.
- Uses localized `edminboostAnmData` (same nonce action as admin UI).

### `packages/core/admin/js/edminboost-anm-notices.js`

- Loaded when admin bar panel is shown, style is dropdown (`dropdown`, `dropdown_compact`), and user has capability — in wp-admin or on the front end when `is_admin_bar_showing()` (via `EDMINBOOST_ANM_Notices::enqueue_admin_bar_dropdown_script()`).
- Targets `#wp-admin-bar-edminboost-anm-notices` — toggles `#edminboost-anm-notices-panel` with `aria-expanded`, click-outside close, Escape key.
- `positionPanel()` — fixed placement with viewport clamping (`left`, `maxWidth`; width from measured panel or 480 detailed / 360 compact fallback); left admin bar positions avoid overlapping the wp-admin menu; clears inline position on close.
- Panel row actions (hide for me/all, display as normal) use localized `edminboostAnmNotices` (`ajaxUrl`, `nonce`, `badgeStyle`, `i18n`). Markup from `edminboost-anm-notice-panel-dropdown.php` via admin bar `meta.html` (`$edminboost_anm_panel_layout` `detailed`|`compact`); hide buttons wrap label text in `.edminboost-anm-notices-panel__action-label`.
- After hide actions, `updateBadgeCount()` respects `badgeStyle` (dot/none/capped counts via `formatBadgeDisplayCount`).

### `packages/core/admin/js/edminboost-anm-notice-inline.js`

- Loaded on wp-admin when plugin enabled and user has `EDMINBOOST_ANM_Settings::CAPABILITY`, **except** on plugin screens (`! EDMINBOOST_ANM_Admin::is_plugin_screen()`).
- Injects `.edminboost-anm-notice-inline-actions` on eligible `.notice` / `.update-nag` nodes; respects `edminboostAnmNoticeInline.cssIgnoreSelectors` from settings.
- POSTs to `edminboost_anm_notice_hide` via localized `edminboostAnmNotices` (same nonce action as admin UI).

`edminboostAnmData` shape (plugin screens + interceptor):

```javascript
{
	ajaxUrl: string,
	nonce: string,
	pageSlug: string,
	rulesContext: 'site' | 'network',
	multisite: {
		isMultisite: boolean,
		policy: string,
		siteCanEditSettings: boolean,
		siteCanEditRules: boolean,
		networkSettingsUrl: string
	},
	noticePanelPositionLayouts: { [positionSlug: string]: string }, // e.g. left, right, profile_before
	i18n: {
		saved, confirmDelete, ruleSaved, ruleDeleted,
		importSuccess, importError, actionSuccess, actionError,
		createRule, editRule, statusActive, statusInactive,
		seedSuccess, seedError, triggerError, viewInbox,
		undoSnooze,
		convertedToRule, undoConversion, alreadyConverted,
		resetHiddenSuccess, resetHiddenError, resetHiddenConfirmAll,
		digestPreviewLoading, digestPreviewError,
		digestPreviewAtGlance, digestPreviewRecent, digestPreviewNoNotices,
		digestPreviewBlocked, digestPreviewRules,
		webhookPreviewLoading, webhookPreviewError,
		webhookPreviewSample, webhookPreviewInbox,
		noticePanelPreview*, noticePanelSample*,
		displayExperiencePreview*, generalOptionsPreview*, // General tab live preview copy
		whiteLabelPreview* // White label tab live preview copy
	}
}
```

## CSS (`packages/core/admin/css/edminboost-anm-admin.css`)

- Prefix all selectors with `.edminboost-anm-` to avoid admin conflicts.
- Layout: `.edminboost-anm-wrap`, `.edminboost-anm-hero`, `.edminboost-anm-card`, `.edminboost-anm-status`.
- Status modifiers: `.is-active`, `.is-inactive`, `.is-ready`.
- Page modifiers: `.edminboost-anm-settings`, `.edminboost-anm-settings-tabs`, `.edminboost-anm-tab-panel`, `.edminboost-anm-settings-form.is-tab-tools`, `.edminboost-anm-settings-form.is-settings-readonly`, `.edminboost-anm-multisite-policy-form`, `.edminboost-anm-segmented`, `.edminboost-anm-display-experience*`, `.edminboost-anm-display-experience-layout*`, `.edminboost-anm-general-options-layout*`, `.edminboost-anm-white-label-layout*`, `.edminboost-anm-white-label-preview*`, `.edminboost-anm-display-experience-preview*`, `.edminboost-anm-general-options-preview*`, `.edminboost-anm-hiding-visibility-options*`, `.edminboost-anm-notice-handling-table` (short Inbox/Hide/Default selects only), `.edminboost-anm-digest-layout__columns`, `.edminboost-anm-redirect-block-*`, `.edminboost-anm-billing*`, `.edminboost-anm-billing-table*`, inbox list table, rules presets. General preview frames use `[hidden]` / `data-*` attrs for CSS-driven mock states (update nags, hidden notice badge).
- Help tips: `.edminboost-anm-help-tip`, `.edminboost-anm-help-tip-popup`.
- Notifications previews: `.edminboost-anm-digest-preview*`, `.edminboost-anm-digest-layout__preview`, `.edminboost-anm-webhook-preview*` (notice-type modifiers `.is-info`, `.is-success`, `.is-warning`, `.is-error`).
- Admin bar (live + settings mock): `.edminboost-anm-notices--dropdown`, `.edminboost-anm-notices--bell`, `.edminboost-anm-notices--facebook`, `.edminboost-anm-notices-badge--pulse`, `.edminboost-anm-notices-panel--compact`, `.edminboost-anm-notice-panel-layout__preview`, `.edminboost-anm-notice-panel-preview*` (preview colors via CSS vars scoped under `#edminboost-anm-notice-panel-preview`; bell triggers use `dashicons dashicons-bell` with `#wpadminbar` `:before` glyph `\f16d`).
- Admin bar: `.edminboost-anm-notices--open`, `.edminboost-anm-notices-badge`, `.edminboost-anm-howdy-dot`.
- Live admin bar dropdown lives under `#wpadminbar` — WordPress `#wpadminbar *` resets affect badges, panel copy, and dashicons. Use scoped `#wpadminbar .edminboost-anm-notices-panel` / `#wp-admin-bar-edminboost-anm-notices .edminboost-anm-notices-badge` overrides (`box-sizing`, `line-height: 1`, flex badge layout, dashicons `:before` reset). Hide actions use `.edminboost-anm-notices-panel__action--hide` with `.edminboost-anm-notices-panel__action-label` (underlined text + dashicon). Keep settings mock (`.edminboost-anm-notice-panel-preview*`) aligned with live badge and action styling.

## Partials (`packages/core/admin/partials/`)

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `edminboost-anm-dashboard-page.php` | Status, stats, importer shortcuts |
| `edminboost-anm-inbox-page.php` | Inbox list table shell (filters, bulk actions) |
| `edminboost-anm-inbox-table-rows.php` | `<tr>` rows only — included from page render and AJAX `rows` HTML |
| `edminboost-anm-rules-page.php` | Filter rules CRUD + WP preset conversion UI |
| `edminboost-anm-settings-page.php` | Tabbed Settings API form — tabs: `general`, `notices`, `access`, `admin_bar`, `filtering`, `security`, `notifications`, `white_label`, `tools` (Migration); optional `multisite` when multisite active (hidden on network defaults screen via `$edminboost_anm_hide_multisite_tab`). Legacy `?tab=upsell` → `filtering`. General: two-column live previews. White label: agency branding + live preview. Notifications: digest two-column layout + webhook preview. Security: redirect blocklist. Tools: importer/export. Read-only notice + `.is-settings-readonly` when `$edminboost_anm_settings_readonly`. Supports alternate `$edminboost_anm_option_name` / `$edminboost_anm_settings_group` for network defaults. |
| `edminboost-anm-network-policy-page.php` | Network multisite policy form (Settings API group `NETWORK_POLICY_GROUP`; includes shared policy partials) |
| `edminboost-anm-multisite-policy-fields.php` | Shared policy select + override checkboxes (network policy page + Settings Multisite tab) |
| `edminboost-anm-multisite-policy-next-steps.php` | Contextual links after policy fields (network vs site Settings) |
| `edminboost-anm-billing-page.php` | Free vs Pro comparison table + external upgrade CTA (`EDMINBOOST_ANM_PRO_URL`); rows from `get_billing_comparison_rows()` |
| `edminboost-anm-notice-panel-dropdown.php` | Admin bar dropdown preview list (max 8 notices) |

- Reusable row/panel partials: set `$edminboost_anm_*` variables before `include`; document `@var` at top.
- Use `fieldset` + `form-table` for grouped settings; label every input.
- Settings checkboxes use nested keys under `EDMINBOOST_ANM_Settings::OPTION_NAME`.
- Notice panel settings (Admin bar tab): style, position, badge, colors only — no `notice_panel[enabled]` checkbox in UI (`sanitize()` keeps `notice_panel.enabled` true). Options from `get_notice_panel_styles()`, `get_notice_panel_positions()`, `get_notice_panel_badge_styles()`; colors under `notice_panel[colors]`.
- Notices tab: per-level handling selects use short mode labels (`Inbox` / `Hide` / `Default`) without the long mode legend list.
- Use `checked()` helper for checkbox state.

## Enqueuing

| Handle | File | When |
|--------|------|------|
| `edminboost-anm-admin` (style) | `admin/css/edminboost-anm-admin.css` | Plugin screens + network plugin screens (deps: `list-tables` on inbox/settings, `dashicons`); inline notice-hide CSS on plugin screens |
| `edminboost-anm-admin` (script) | `admin/js/edminboost-anm-admin.js` | Plugin screens + network plugin screens |
| `list-tables` (style) | WordPress core | Inbox and Settings plugin screens |
| `dashicons` (style) | WordPress core | Plugin screens; admin bar notice panel (live) |
| `edminboost-anm-notices` (style) | same CSS file | wp-admin when enabled; front end when admin bar panel active for capable user (deps include `dashicons` when panel shown) |
| `edminboost-anm-notices` (script) | `admin/js/edminboost-anm-notices.js` | Dropdown styles in wp-admin or front-end admin bar |
| `edminboost-anm-notice-inline` (script) | `admin/js/edminboost-anm-notice-inline.js` | wp-admin (non–plugin screens) when plugin enabled + capability |
| `edminboost-anm-interceptor` (script) | `admin/js/edminboost-anm-interceptor.js` | All wp-admin when plugin enabled |

Version: `EDMINBOOST_ANM_VERSION` for plugin handles.
